        { "id": "cmt_1b5fks", "address": "$6AE8", "text": "Zone 5: \"THIS KIOSK IS A NUCLEAR FREE ZONE\"\nHeader at +$98: $14 $04 $00 $08 $00 $0b $01 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
        { "id": "cmt_n1gjw0", "address": "$6AE8", "text": "ZONE 5 of 42: \"THIS KIOSK IS A NUCLEAR FREE ZONE\"\n\n  +152 -> $53  $14\n  +153 -> $52  $04\n  +154 -> $51  $00\n  +155 -> $42  $08   live object slots\n  +156 -> $02  $00   sprite bank index -> $1000\n  +157 -> $D025 sprite multicolour 0 = $0b\n  +158 -> $D026 sprite multicolour 1 = $01\n  +159 read and thrown away ($00)\n\n+0..+151 are the eight creature templates; see the comment at $1DA0. +160..+199 is the title above, in screen codes for the font at $2000." },
        { "id": "cmt_9aa2al", "address": "$6BB0", "text": "ZONE 6 of 42: \"HAVEN·T WE MET SOMEWHERE BEFORE·\"\n\n  +152 -> $53  $ff\n  +153 -> $52  $00\n  +154 -> $51  $00\n  +155 -> $42  $06   live object slots\n  +156 -> $02  $00   sprite bank index -> $1000\n  +157 -> $D025 sprite multicolour 0 = $0e\n  +158 -> $D026 sprite multicolour 1 = $08\n  +159 read and thrown away ($00)\n\n+0..+151 are the eight creature templates; see the comment at $1DA0. +160..+199 is the title above, in screen codes for the font at $2000." },
