        { "id": "cmt_fccy3o", "address": "$6E08", "text": "Zone 9: \"TELECOM'S COMEUPPANCE\"\nHeader at +$98: $a0 $80 $00 $08 $00 $0b $01 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
