        { "id": "cmt_e7g82j", "address": "$6ED0", "text": "Zone 10: \"HAVE A GO AT THESE!!!\"\nHeader at +$98: $00 $00 $00 $08 $00 $00 $00 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
