        { "id": "cmt_euew4c", "address": "$7060", "text": "Zone 12: \"FISH 'N' PHOTONS???\"\nHeader at +$98: $19 $00 $00 $08 $00 $0a $07 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
