        { "id": "cmt_9bl4ll", "address": "$7128", "text": "Zone 13: \"THROUGH PASTURES BLUE!!!\"\nHeader at +$98: $0a $00 $00 $08 $00 $0a $07 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
