        { "id": "cmt_ipctpz", "address": "$71F0", "text": "Zone 14: \"Z A P S T A R S\"\nHeader at +$98: $43 $00 $01 $08 $00 $06 $07 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
