        { "id": "cmt_e8qhk8", "address": "$7380", "text": "Zone 16: \"SILLY SILICON\"\nHeader at +$98: $03 $00 $00 $08 $00 $0c $06 $00 = multicolour mask, Y-expand mask, X-expand mask, sprite count, sprite-bank index, SPMC0, SPMC1, unused.\nName is 40 screen codes at +$A0." },
        { "id": "cmt_gmpa7w", "address": "$7380", "text": "ZONE 16 of 42: \"SILLY  SILICON\"\n\n  +152 -> $53  $03\n  +153 -> $52  $00\n  +154 -> $51  $00\n  +155 -> $42  $08   live object slots\n  +156 -> $02  $00   sprite bank index -> $1000\n  +157 -> $D025 sprite multicolour 0 = $0c\n  +158 -> $D026 sprite multicolour 1 = $06\n  +159 read and thrown away ($00)\n\n+0..+151 are the eight creature templates; see the comment at $1DA0. +160..+199 is the title above, in screen codes for the font at $2000." },
        { "id": "cmt_lgg6oe", "address": "$7448", "text": "ZONE 17 of 42: \"JUGGLIN·  CHOPTERS\"\n\n  +152 -> $53  $01\n  +153 -> $52  $00\n  +154 -> $51  $00\n  +155 -> $42  $08   live object slots\n  +156 -> $02  $00   sprite bank index -> $1000\n  +157 -> $D025 sprite multicolour 0 = $00\n  +158 -> $D026 sprite multicolour 1 = $06\n  +159 read and thrown away ($00)\n\n+0..+151 are the eight creature templates; see the comment at $1DA0. +160..+199 is the title above, in screen codes for the font at $2000." },
