        { "id": "cmt_m5fpdt", "address": "$85DE", "text": "Zone 10 (0-indexed 9), $6700+9*200=$85DE. Clean 4-step transform chain with 4 distinct sprites: type0 ($E5,1f,32t)->type1($E6-E7,2f,32t)->type2($E8,1f,1t)->type3($E8,1f,life=0=never ages, sits until shot). Types 4/6/7 present but unreached by any nextType in this zone. Types 0-3 all AND #$3F-masked colour data at record+$20 confirmed distinct too. Picked over zone4/ATTACK OF THE MUTANT MUTANT CAMELS because that zones chain (type5->type4) shares one sprite ($CD) across the pair and most of its other types share $91-$93, so a diagram of TELECOMS COMEUPPANCE shows more." },
        { "id": "cmt_dnqi6c", "address": "$8640", "text": "ZONE 40 of 42: \"BEASTLY BONANZA\"\n\n  +152 -> $53  $01\n  +153 -> $52  $00\n  +154 -> $51  $00\n  +155 -> $42  $08   live object slots\n  +156 -> $02  $06   sprite bank index -> $4800\n  +157 -> $D025 sprite multicolour 0 = $01\n  +158 -> $D026 sprite multicolour 1 = $06\n  +159 read and thrown away ($00)\n\n+0..+151 are the eight creature templates; see the comment at $1DA0. +160..+199 is the title above, in screen codes for the font at $2000." },
